{"sourceUrl":"https://me.sjtu.edu.cn/YanJS/mainnotice/7668.html","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T17:03:28.366848+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://me.sjtu.edu.cn/YanJS/mainnotice/7668.html","html":"<div>\n<p><span><span>机械与动力工程学院是上海交通大学最具影响力的院系之一</span></span><span>，</span><span>是</span><span><span>国家首批教育体制改革试点学院、教育部首批</span><span>“三全育人”综合改革试点学院。学院秉承“起点高、基础厚、要求严、重实践、求创新”的办学传统，瞄准世界科技前沿和国家重大战略需求，聚焦智能制造、高端装备、航空航天、低碳能源、核电</span></span><span>等</span><span>领域，以建设具有中国特色的世界一流学院为目标，培养具有国际视野和中国情怀的拔尖创新人才。</span></p><p><span><span>为进一步增进全国高校优秀大学生对</span></span><span><span>机械与动力工程学院</span></span><span><span>的了解，</span></span><span><span>学院现开展</span><span>2026</span><span>年暑期学术交流营活动</span></span><span><span>。欢迎有志于来学院深造的优秀学子（</span>2027<span>年应届本科毕业生）报名参加！</span></span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><strong><span><span>一、</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>报名条件</span></span></strong></p><p><span>1. </span><span><span>拥护中国共产党，热爱祖国，品德优良，遵纪守法，身心健康。</span></span></p><p><span>2. </span><span><span>诚实守信，学风端正。不存在考试作弊、剽窃他人学术成果等有违学术道德、专业伦理的行为以及其他违法违纪受处分或受处罚记录。</span></span></p><p><span>3. </span><span><span>健康状况需符合教育部规定的研究生招考体检标准。</span></span></p><p><span>4. </span><span><span>毕业高校为</span><span>“</span><span>双一流</span><span>”</span><span>建设高校及建设学科或国家重点学科的优秀本科三年级在校生（</span><span>202</span></span><span>7</span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>应届</span></span><span><span>毕业</span></span><span><span>本科生</span></span><span><span>）；鼓励学科交叉，工程或相关学科专业的优秀学生积极</span></span><span><span>报名</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span>5. </span><span><span>本科阶段综合素质优秀、学习成绩优秀，英语合格（</span>CET6≥425<span>或</span><span>TOEFL≥90</span><span>或</span><span>IELTS≥6.0</span><span>）。</span></span></p><p><span>6. </span><span><span>上海交通大学（含机械与动力工程学院）的</span></span><span><span>学生</span></span><span><span>也依据以上条件</span></span><span><span>报名</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span>二、</span><strong><span><span>活动安排</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>学院</span></span><span>暂定</span><span>7<span>月下旬举办不同类别的学术交流活动，活动内容包含：</span></span><span>学生汇报与交流、专题学术讲座</span><span><span>等，均在上海交通大学闵行校区线下进行。</span></span></p><table><tbody><tr><td><p><strong><span>参营类别</span></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>专业类别</span></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>专业名称</span></strong></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\"><p><span>博士营</span></p><p><span>（含荣誉计划、各类专项计划）</span></p></td><td><p><span>学术型</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>080200 </span><span>机械工程</span></span></p><p><span><span>0802Z1</span><span>工业工程</span></span></p><p><span><span>080700 </span><span>动力工程及工程热物理</span></span></p><p><span><span>082700 </span><span>核科学与技术</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>专业型</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>085</span></span><span>500</span><span> <span>机械</span></span><span>（</span><span>含工业工程</span><span>）</span></p><p><span><span>08</span></span><span>5800</span><span> <span>能源动力</span><span>—动力工程</span></span></p><p><span><span>085</span></span><span>800</span><span> <span>能源动力</span><span>—核能与核技术工程</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\"><p><span>硕士营</span></p><p><span>（含各类专项计划）</span></p></td><td><p><span>学术型</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>080200 </span><span>机械工程</span></span></p><p><span><span>080200 </span><span>机械工程（工业工程）</span></span></p><p><span><span>080700 </span><span>动力工程及工程热物理</span></span></p><p><span><span>082700 </span><span>核科学与技术</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>专业型</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>085</span></span><span>500</span><span> <span>机械</span></span><span>—</span><span>机械工程</span></p><p><span><span>085</span></span><span>500</span><span> <span>机械</span></span><span>—</span><span>工业工程</span></p><p><span><span>08</span></span><span>5800</span><span> <span>能源动力</span><span>—动力工程</span></span></p><p><span><span>085</span></span><span>800</span><span> <span>能源动力</span><span>—核能与核技术工程</span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong><span> </span></strong></p><p><span>三、</span><strong><span><span>报</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>名流程</span></span></strong></p><p><span>1. </span><strong><span><span>报名时间：</span></span></strong><span>7</span><span><span>月</span></span><span>1</span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span>12</span></span><span>:00</span><span><span>-</span></span><span>7</span><span><span>月</span></span><span>1</span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>日</span>17:00<span>。</span></span></p><p><span>2. </span><strong><span><span>报名方式：</span></span></strong><span><span>登录</span><span>“</span><span>上海交通大学研究生院招生网</span><span>”</span><span>进行网上报名：</span><span>http://ga.sjtu.edu.cn/zsgl/xlygl/default.aspx</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>一经提交无法</span></span><span><span>修改。</span></span></p><p><span>3. </span><strong><span><span>填报说明：</span></span></strong></p><p><span>(1) </span><span><span>各类别的</span></span><span><span>学术</span></span><span>交流</span><span><span>营</span></span><span><span>仅可参加其一，不能同时申请。</span></span></p><p><span>(2) </span><span><span>意向报名</span></span><span><span>荣誉计划</span></span><span>直博的</span><span><span>同学</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>需提前联系好导师，经导师同意后方可报名，且需在报名系统备注一栏注明</span><span>“</span><span>荣誉计划</span><span>”</span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span>(3) </span><span><span>意向</span></span><span><span>报名</span></span><span><span>集成电路专班、工程硕博士专项计划的同学，请在</span></span><span><span>报名界面的</span></span><span><span>专项计划一栏中按意愿</span></span><span><span>选择</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span>(4) </span><span><span>博士生导师名录详见</span></span><span>：</span><span>https://me.sjtu.edu.cn/YanJS/Directory.html<span>。</span></span></p><p><strong><span> </span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>四、申请材料</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>请通过报名系统提交电子版材料，</span></span><span><span>活动</span></span><span><span>现场提交纸质版</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>电子版和纸质版材料需保持一致。所有材料须保证真实有效，若有虚假取消入营资格。</span></span></p><p><span>1. </span><span><span>申请表（入营审查结果公示后下载打印，仅提交纸质版）；</span></span></p><p><span>2. </span><span><span>学籍认证报告（学信网</span>www.chsi.com.cn<span>在线验证并下载）；</span></span></p><p><span>3. </span><span><span>本科成绩单</span>1<span>份（加盖所在学校教务处或所在学院本科生教务办的公章，电子版需彩印）；</span></span></p><p><span>4. </span><span><span>专业成绩排名证明</span>1<span>份（加盖所在学校教务处 或 所在学院本科生教务办的公章）；</span></span></p><p><span>5. </span><span><span>英语成绩单（</span></span><span>CET6<span>、</span><span>TOEFL</span><span>、</span><span>IELTS</span><span>）</span></span><span><span>复印件或彩印的电子版成绩单；</span></span></p><p><span>6. </span><span><span>主要的获奖证书扫描件；</span></span></p><p><span>7. </span><span><span>学术科研成果（论文、专利）。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>申请致远荣誉计划</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>博士</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>生的同学，</span></span></strong><strong><span>须再</span></strong><strong><span><span>准备如下材料：</span></span></strong></p><p><span>1. </span><span><span>研究计划书一份（与报名导师协商后撰写）；</span></span></p><p><span>2. </span><span><span>推荐信两封（格式不限，需推荐人签名）。</span></span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><strong><span><span>五、</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>入营审查</span></span></strong><strong><span> </span></strong></p><p><span><span>报名截止后，由学院</span></span><span>招生</span><span><span>委员会根据申请者材料进行入</span></span><span>营</span><span><span>资格审查。</span></span><span><span>入</span></span><span>营</span><span><span>者名单将于七月中下旬在上海交通大学研究生招生网公示，未入选者不再另行通知。</span></span></p><p><span><span>活动具体安排将以电子邮件形式通知入</span></span><span>营</span><span><span>学生。</span></span><span><span>请确保在报名系统中填写的邮箱填写正确，并保持联系方式畅通。</span></span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><strong><span><span>六</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>、其他</span></span></strong></p><p><span>1. </span><span><span>咨询方式：</span></span><span><span>郝老师</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span>021-34207253</span><span><span>，</span></span><a href=\"mailto:me-yanjiaoban@sjtu.edu.cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span>me-yanjiaoban@sjtu.edu.cn</span></span></a></p><p><span>2. <span>本次活动不收取任何费用，入</span></span><span>营</span><span><span>学生交通食宿自理。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3. </span><span>申请人应承诺填报信息和提交材料的真实性。若有弄虚作假，一经发现将取消申请资格。</span></span></p><p><strong><span> </span></strong></p><p><strong><span> </span></strong></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span><span>机械与动力工程学院</span></span></p><p><span>2026<span>年</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>1</span><span>日</span></span></p><p><br/></p>\n</div>","textSha256":"cc06b126d29116cfcf93c60a1ca0870187e48dbb9f67b4d843a61248df13d4e7","textLength":1809,"sourceSha256":"40db840c3152938cd4ba1b5f792ecf7e78a659c027c16c85b101d066c59b314b","selector":".snr","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-73e2d54b70faab9393fc","title":"2026年上海交通大学机械与动力工程学院2026年暑期学术交流营","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T17:03:28.366848+00:00"}
